<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,0,0]]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<Structure DataType="TIMER">
<DataValueMember Name="PRE" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="ACC" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="EN" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="TT" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="DN" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
</Structure>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="Hold" DataType="TIMER" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,0,0]]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<Structure DataType="TIMER">
<DataValueMember Name="PRE" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="ACC" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="EN" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="TT" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="DN" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
</Structure>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OneShot2" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OneShot" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OldSetpointHMI" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OldSetpointPLC" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LES(SecurityCurrentLevelTag,MinAccessLevel)OTE(Inactive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(VisibilityCondition)OTE(Invisible);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(VisibilityResetBtn)OTE(ResetInvisible);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This logic Is For The Reset Button To Clear The Count Value]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ResetTrigger)XIO(ResetInvisible)XIO(Invisible)XIO(Inactive)[XIO(UsePressHoldFeature) ,XIC(UsePressHoldFeature) MOV(PressHoldTimeMsec,HoldTimer.PRE) TON(HoldTimer,?,?) XIC(HoldTimer.DN) ]ONS(OutputPulseOneShot)MOV(0,CountsGeneralTag.Count);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[IndicatorStatus is used to display the color and text on the indicator light on the reset button background (Title Background)

When Button Status Equals:
0 - Indicator Is Invisible, Not Used
1 - Hold (Button is pressed and Count is not reset)
2 - Output Active (Button is pressed and Count is reset)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(ResetTrigger) MOV(0,IndicatorStatus) ,XIC(ResetTrigger) [XIC(UsePressHoldFeature) [XIO(HoldTimer.DN) MOV(1,IndicatorStatus) ,XIC(HoldTimer.DN) MOV(2,IndicatorStatus) ] ,XIO(UsePressHoldFeature) MOV(2,IndicatorStatus) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[HMi HMI cannot acces the CountsGeneralTag because when a UDT is used the external access get set to none. Therefore, some extra parameters wer created for the HMI to Access.
The this mapping connects the CountsGeneralTag to these additional parameters (Count, Setpoint, BorderColorStatus)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(CountsGeneralTag.HMIColorStatus,BorderColorStatus)MOV(CountsGeneralTag.Count,Count)[NEQ(CountsGeneralTag.Setpoint,OldSetpointPLC) MOV(CountsGeneralTag.Setpoint,Setpoint) MOV(CountsGeneralTag.Setpoint,OldSetpointPLC) ,NEQ(Setpoint,OldSetpointHMI) MOV(Setpoint,CountsGeneralTag.Setpoint) MOV(Setpoint,OldSetpointHMI) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="HMI_NumericDispEntry" Class="Standard" Revision="2.0" Vendor="Steven Douglas Corp." ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2018-08-02T18:31:13.194Z" CreatedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\wehamby" EditedDate="2021-06-03T12:56:41.888Z" EditedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\wehamby"
 SoftwareRevision="v32.02">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Use For A Number Display Or Input With Security Permissions
(Use For PanelView 5000)]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[Added Selection for output tag - W.E.H 10/16/2018
Added scaling factor. i.e. 25.4 for mm in PLC, inches on HMI. - D.E.S. 2019-11-01
Fixed Issue with new/old value overwriting - W.E.H. 01/30/2020
2_0 - Added Gretout condition - W.E.H. 05/03/2021]]>
</RevisionNote>
<Parameters>
<Parameter Name="EnableIn" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Input - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="EnableOut" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Output - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Value" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Input" Radix="Float" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="VisibilityCondition" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Condition To Make The Graphic Visible]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="SecurityCurrentLevelTag" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Current Security Level Of The Logged In User]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="MinAccessLevel" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Minimum Security Acess Level For Numeric Entry Operation]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Invisible" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Used By HMI to make Graphic Invisible]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Inactive" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Used By HMI To Make Numeric Entry Active/Inactive]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="UseDintOutputTagForValue" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Do You Want To Map the Value to a Specified REAL Output Tag (1=Yes 0=No)]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="OutputTagDINT" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Usage="InOut" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" Constant="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[The tag to use for mapping the current value (DINT)]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="UseRealOutputTagForValue" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Do You Want To Map the Value to a Specified DINT Output Tag (1=Yes 0=No)]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="OutputTagREAL" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="InOut" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" Constant="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[The tag to use for mapping the current value (REAL)]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Scaling" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Input" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Conversion for HMI display and input only. (25.4 => HMI displays in. PLC uses mm) (1 => none)]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="GreyOutCondition" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Condition To Make The Button GeryedOut
(In conjunction with Access Level)]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
</Parameters>
<LocalTags>
<LocalTag Name="OldDINT" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OldREAL" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OldValue" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="OldScaling" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[LES(SecurityCurrentLevelTag,MinAccessLevel) ,XIC(GreyOutCondition) ]OTE(Inactive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(VisibilityCondition)OTE(Invisible);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This logic allows the OutputTag to be written to instead of only read by logic in some other routine.
Check to see if the specified output tag (DINT) has been changed by the logic somewhere else. If so copy it to the Value tag. OldDINT is used to remember that last value
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(UseDintOutputTagForValue)[NEQ(Value,OldValue) MOV(Value,OldValue) [EQU(Scaling,0) MOV(Value,OutputTagDINT) ,NEQ(Scaling,0) MUL(Value,Scaling,OutputTagDINT) ] MOV(OutputTagDINT,OldDINT) ,[NEQ(OutputTagDINT,OldDINT) MOV(OutputTagDINT,OldDINT) ,NEQ(Scaling,OldScaling) MOV(Scaling,OldScaling) ] [EQU(Scaling,0) MOV(OutputTagDINT,Value) ,NEQ(Scaling,0) DIV(OutputTagDINT,Scaling,Value) ] MOV(Value,OldValue) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This logic allows the OutputTag to be written to instead of only read by logic in some other routine.
Check to see if the specified output tag (REAL) has been changed by the logic somewhere else. If so copy it to the Value tag. OldREAL is used to remember that last value
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(UseRealOutputTagForValue)[NEQ(Value,OldValue) MOV(Value,OldValue) [EQU(Scaling,0) MOV(Value,OutputTagREAL) ,NEQ(Scaling,0) MUL(Value,Scaling,OutputTagREAL) ] MOV(OutputTagREAL,OldREAL) ,[NEQ(OutputTagREAL,OldREAL) MOV(OutputTagREAL,OldREAL) ,NEQ(Scaling,OldScaling) MOV(Scaling,OldScaling) ] [EQU(Scaling,0) MOV(OutputTagREAL,Value) ,NEQ(Scaling,0) DIV(OutputTagREAL,Scaling,Value) ] MOV(Value,OldValue) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="HMI_OpnPopup" Class="Standard" Revision="1.0" Vendor="Steven Douglas Corp." ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2014-09-11T17:38:56.392Z" CreatedBy="BillHambyLaptop\Bill" EditedDate="2018-06-27T18:27:41.557Z" EditedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\wehamby"
 SoftwareRevision="v30.00">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Button With Momentary To Open Popup Screen
(Use For PanelView 5000)]]>
</Description>
<Parameters>
<Parameter Name="EnableIn" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Input - System Defined Parameter]]>
