<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any General Program Faults Present
--Look at all "NoFaults" declared in specific programs--]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Main.FaultActive)XIO(\HMI.FaultActive)XIO(\Mode.FaultActive)XIO(\Comms.FaultActive)XIO(\Chassis.FaultActive)XIO(\Chassis.IndexPermFaultActive)XIO(\Recipe.FaultActive)XIO(\Production.FaultActive)XIO(\Logging.FaultActive)OTE(NoGeneralProgramFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any Machine Station Faults Present
--Look at "Faulted" Status In Tracking Data for each Station OpStatus--]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[1].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[2].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[3].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[4].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[5].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[6].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[7].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[8].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[9].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[10].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[11].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[12].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[13].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[14].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[15].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[16].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[17].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[18].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[19].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[20].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[21].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[22].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[23].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[24].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[25].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[26].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[27].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[28].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[29].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[30].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[30].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[31].OpStatus.Faulted)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[32].OpStatus.Faulted)OTE(NoStationFaults);]]>
</Text>
