</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\BobbinFeeder.FaultActive)XIO(\WireDereeler.FaultActive)XIO(\WireFeedCut.FaultActive)XIO(\RobotBobbin.FaultActive)XIO(\DiodeFeedCut.FaultActive)XIO(\DiodeTransfer.FaultActive)XIO(\RobotUnload.FaultActive)XIO(\TrayElevator.FaultActive)XIO(\TrayInfeed.FaultActive)XIO(\TrayQueue.FaultActive)XIO(\TrayLoadOutfeed.FaultActive)XIO(\TerminalDereeler.FaultActive)OTE(NoAuxFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any Machine Faults Present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(NoGeneralProgramFaults)XIC(NoStationFaults)XIC(NoAuxFaults)OTE(NoMachineFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any General Program Warnings Present
--Look at all "NoFaults" declared in specific programs--]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Main.WarningActive)XIO(\HMI.WarningActive)XIO(\Mode.WarningActive)XIO(\Comms.WarningActive)XIO(\Chassis.WarningActive)XIO(\Recipe.WarningActive)XIO(\Production.WarningActive)XIO(\Logging.WarningActive)OTE(NoGeneralProgramWarnings);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any Machine Station Warnings Present
--Look at "Warning" Status In Tracking Data for each Station OpStatus--]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[1].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[2].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[2].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[3].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[4].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[5].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[6].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[7].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[8].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[9].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[10].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[11].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[12].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[13].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[14].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[15].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[16].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[17].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[18].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[19].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[20].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[21].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[22].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[23].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[24].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[25].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[26].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[27].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[28].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[29].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[30].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[30].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[31].OpStatus.Warning)XIO(\Tracking.Data.Station[32].OpStatus.Warning)OTE(NoStationWarnings);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any Auxiliary Device Warnings Present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\BobbinFeeder.WarningActive)XIO(\WireDereeler.WarningActive)XIO(\WireFeedCut.WarningActive)XIO(\RobotBobbin.WarningActive)XIO(\DiodeFeedCut.WarningActive)XIO(\DiodeTransfer.WarningActive)XIO(\RobotUnload.WarningActive)XIO(\TrayElevator.WarningActive)XIO(\TrayInfeed.WarningActive)XIO(\TrayQueue.WarningActive)XIO(\TrayLoadOutfeed.WarningActive)OTE(NoAuxWarnings);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check For Any Machine Warnings Present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(NoGeneralProgramWarnings)XIC(NoStationWarnings)XIC(NoAuxWarnings)OTE(NoMachineWarnings);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear the Active Alarm list in case it has been corrupted via a PLC program download.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(S:FS) ,XIC(NoMachineWarnings) XIC(NoMachineFaults) ONS(OneShot.5) ]COP(ZeroAlarmData,Active[0],1)COP(Active[0],Active[1],15);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Logic for handling the alarm displays developed for the PV5500.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Show Alarm popup when an alarm is present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(NoMachineFaults)ONS(OneShot.0)NEQ(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90)NEQ(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91)MOV(90,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Close "Active Alarms" popup 90 or "All Active Alarms" screen 91 (If its showing) when there are no alarms present

Writing 9999 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will close the pop up being displayed on the HMI
Writing 8888 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will execute a NavBack command to return to previous screen on the HMI]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(NoMachineWarnings)XIC(NoMachineFaults)MOV(1500,Tmr_DlyClose.PRE)TON(Tmr_DlyClose,?,?)XIC(Tmr_DlyClose.DN)[EQU(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90) ONS(OneShot.1) MOV(9999,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ,EQU(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91) ONS(OneShot.10) MOV(8888,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Alarm History Display]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)[SIZE(History[0],0,HistSize) ,SIZE(HistoryDisplay[0],0,S_DispSize) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,99)[ONS(OneShot.2) MOV(0,DisplayListPointer) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageUp) ONS(OneShot.3) [GEQ(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.8) ,XIO(OneShot.8) LES(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) MOV(0,DisplayListPointer) ] ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollDown) ONS(OneShot.4) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollUp) ONS(OneShot.6) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageDown) ONS(OneShot.7) CPT(tempPtrCheck,HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize) [LES(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.9) ,XIO(OneShot.9) GEQ(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,HistSize-S_DispSize) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[COP(History[DisplayListPointer],HistoryDisplay[0],13);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
