<Routines>
<Routine Name="CalcDialStationNestNums" Type="ST">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Calculate the nest number at each station positon around  the main Dial.]]>
</Description>
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[//Set nest_Num for all the Stations]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[//OnStationTol can cause the TRUNC value to be (Station_Qty + 1) so it was necessary to add the (Station_Qty -1) offset along with the MOD Station_Qty + 1 to correct it.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="3">
<![CDATA[//Written by W.E.H 2021-03-25. Copy From AOI -> Traking_Calc_Station_NestNums_V1_4. origionallty written by 2013-10-11 D.E.S.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="4">
<![CDATA[//]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[//  All station nest numbers are calculated now instead of just 2 thru NestQty (the way it was done previously)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="7">
<![CDATA[NewNestNum := ((TRUNC(Status.DialPosNests + OnStationTolNests) + (Setup_NestQty - 1)) MOD Setup_NestQty) + 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="8">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="9">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="10">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="11">
<![CDATA[IF (\Tracking.Data.Station[1].NestNum = NewNestNum) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="12">
<![CDATA[	NestsShiftedPulse := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="13">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="14">
<![CDATA[	\Tracking.Data.Station[1].NestNum := NewNestNum;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="15">
<![CDATA[	NestsShiftedPulse := 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="16">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="17">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="18">
<![CDATA[FOR iStaNum := 1 TO Setup_NestQty by 1 DO]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="19">
<![CDATA[	\Tracking.Data.Station[iStaNum].NestNum := (NewNestNum - iStaNum + Setup_NestQty) MOD Setup_NestQty + 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="20">
<![CDATA[END_FOR;]]>
</Line>
</STContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="DriveTrainStateLogic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calls To Subroutines That Are Scanned Prior To The Drive Train Logic

NOTE: If Reject History Is Used It MUST Be Scanned Before Tracking Data Is Deleted]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(PositionCalcs,0)JSR(TorqueLimits,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cam Velocity For Status (In Degrees/Sec)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MUL(Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualVelocity,10000,CamAxisActVelREALTemp)TRN(CamAxisActVelREALTemp,CamAxisActVelREALTemp)DIV(CamAxisActVelREALTemp,10000,Status.ActualVelocity);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Chassis Dial Index Permissives : 
These are the conditions that cause the Dial to crash if not made during Indexing (ex. a cylinder that is inserted into a nest during dwell, but will interfere if not retracted during the dial index)
Use sensors and/or other conditions as the permissives.

NOTE: If any of these permissives are not made when the dial indexes (and a little bit before), the Chassis will Immediately Stop (NOT move to startup location) and cause a fault. A fault condition in the logic will cause the camming to be disabled and the servo to quickly stop independently.
See the Index Permissives fault for more explanation of this condition.

ADDITIONAL NOTE: These permissives typicaly will show when a station/condition is not complete when the dial gets ready to index. Therefore, it is a good idea to generate a fault message for each bit condition in order to help determine the cause
of the index permissives fault.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.0)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.0)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.1)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.1)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.2)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.2)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.3)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.3)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.4)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.4)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.5)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.5)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.6)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.6)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.7)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.7)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.8)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.8)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.9)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.9)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.10)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.10)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.11)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.11)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.12)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.12)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.13)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.13)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.14)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.14)XIC(Setup_IndexPermissiveInput.15)OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus.15)OTE(Control.DialIndexPermsOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Chassis Immediate Stop Conditions : 
These are the conditions that cause the Chassis to Immediately Stop (NOT move to startup location). 
This condition will NOT cause a Chassis fault. 

NOTE:Since this does fault the logic the cam and dial remain cammed together, but stop quickly

These should be faults that occur on the machine that require the chassis to stop at its current location or as soon as possible. These condtions cannot wait for the chassis to continue to the starting location as normal faults do.
Typically these are faults for devices that cause an interference with the dial as it indexes. They probably are the same devices that have been used in the index permissive string. The difference is that the index permissives are checked WHILE the dial is indexing (and a little bit before),
while the immediate stop conditions are always monitored during chassis cam motion.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(\Main.FaultActive) ,XIC(\WireBendDiode90.Fault[2].Active) ,XIC(\WireBendDiode90.Fault[3].Active) ]OTE(Control.ImmedStop);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 0
EStop / Power Off

Note : The servo positions should only be set while they have power removed. This has been included in State 0.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[0])OTU(Status.Stopping)OTU(Status.Running)[XIC(Setup_SafetyCircuitOK) [XIC(Setup_CamAxisTag.AxisHomedStatus) XIC(Setup_DialAxisTag.AxisHomedStatus) XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(1000,Tmr_Startup.PRE) TON(Tmr_Startup,?,?) XIC(Tmr_Startup.DN) MOV(1,StateReg) ,XIO(Setup_CamAxisTag.AxisHomedStatus) ONS(OneShotFault.15) OTL(Fault[15].Active) ,XIO(Setup_DialAxisTag.AxisHomedStatus) ONS(OneShotFault.16) OTL(Fault[16].Active) ] ,XIO(Setup_SafetyCircuitOK) XIC(Control.SetCamPos) MOV(2000,Tmr_SetCamPos.PRE) TON(Tmr_SetCamPos,?,?) XIC(Tmr_SetCamPos.DN) ONS(OneShot.0) MAH(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAH_Cam_Inst) ,XIO(Setup_SafetyCircuitOK) XIC(Control.SetDialPos) MOV(2000,Tmr_SetDialPos.PRE) TON(Tmr_SetDialPos,?,?) XIC(Tmr_SetDialPos.DN) ONS(OneShot.1) MAH(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAH_Dial_Inst) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 1
-Stop Any Active Instructions
(MAS)
-Clear Servo On (MSO) instruction enable Bits

NOTE: The MAS done bit is is outside the branch so the MASR will finish then the MAS is executed when shutdown status goes off.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[1])OTU(CHAS_MSO_CamInst.EN)OTU(CHAS_MSO_DialInst.EN)[XIO(Setup_CamAxisTag.ShutdownStatus) MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_AllCamInst,All,No,10,% of Maximum,No,0,% of Maximum) ,XIC(Setup_CamAxisTag.ShutdownStatus) MASR(Setup_CamAxisTag,MASR_CamInst) XIC(MASR_CamInst.DN) ]XIC(MAS_AllCamInst.DN)[XIO(Setup_DialAxisTag.ShutdownStatus) MAS(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAS_AllDialInst,All,No,10,% of Maximum,No,0,% of Maximum) ,XIC(Setup_DialAxisTag.ShutdownStatus) MASR(Setup_DialAxisTag,MASR_DialInst) XIC(MASR_DialInst.DN) ]XIC(MAS_AllDialInst.DN)MOV(2,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 2
Fault Reset CAM Servo Drive
(MAFR)
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[2])MAFR(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAFR_CamInst)XIC(MAFR_CamInst.DN)MOV(3,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 3
Fault Reset Dial Servo Drive
(MAFR)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[3])MAFR(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAFR_DialInst)XIC(MAFR_DialInst.DN)MOV(6,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 6
Servo On CAM Servo Drive
(MSO)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[6])MSO(Setup_CamAxisTag,CHAS_MSO_CamInst)XIC(CHAS_MSO_CamInst.DN)XIC(Setup_CamAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus)MOV(7,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 7
Servo On DIAL Servo Drive
(MSO)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[7])MSO(Setup_DialAxisTag,CHAS_MSO_DialInst)XIC(CHAS_MSO_DialInst.DN)XIC(Setup_DialAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus)MOV(8,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 8
Servos On, Evaluate Physical Locations (Is the Cam and Dial Syncronized?)

Conceptual Note: The Dial must be on a station position before camming can be enabled.
                                                                                                 If not, when the cam is enabled the Dial axis moves to relative positions in the cam table from its current position.
AKA- the dial will index off location.

-Resync Procedure-
If the Dial is locked by the Cam, the Cam needs to move to a position where the pin is retracted (CamUnlocPos).
The Cam can move forward or reverse to the unock position. A boundary position is chosen (CamFwdRevBndryPos) such that if the Cam's actual position is larger it will travel forward to the unloack posiiton. If the Cam actual position less then the boundary, it will reverse to the unlock position.
Reverse Zone = Unlock Position < Cam Actual Posiiton < Fwd/Rev Boundary Position 
Forward Zone =  Fwd/Rev Boundary Position < Cam Actual Posiiton < Unlock Position ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[8])[XIC(Status.DialOnStation) XIC(Status.CamInDialDwell) MOV(15,StateReg) ,[XIO(Status.DialOnStation) ,XIO(Status.CamInDialDwell) ] [XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank) XIO(Control.ImmedStop) XIC(Control.DialIndexPermsOK) OTE(Status.ResyncRequired) XIC(Control.Resync) [XIO(Status.DialOnStation) [XIO(Status.CamInDialDwell) MOV(11,StateReg) ,XIC(Status.CamInDialDwell) [LIM(DialUnlockPos,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,CamFwdRevBndryPosDeg) MOV(9,StateReg) ,LIM(CamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,DialUnlockPos) MOV(10,StateReg) ] ] ,XIC(Status.DialOnStation) XIO(Status.CamInDialDwell) [LIM(Setup_DialIndexStartCamPosDeg,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg) MOV(12,StateReg) ,LIM(DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,Setup_DialIndexEndCamPosDeg) MOV(13,StateReg) ] ] ,XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(40,StateReg) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 9
Cam Move Reverse To Unlock Position
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[9])OTL(Status.ResyncInProgress)[MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_CamRevUnlkInst,RotaryNegative,DialUnlockPos,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) XIC(MAM_CamRevUnlkInst.PC) MOV(11,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 10
Cam Move Forward To Unlock Position
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[10])OTL(Status.ResyncInProgress)[MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_CamFwdUnlkInst,RotaryPositive,DialUnlockPos,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) XIC(MAM_CamFwdUnlkInst.PC) MOV(11,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 11
Dial Move Reverse To Station if Within 0.1 Head Position, otherwise move forward to Next Station
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[11])OTL(Status.ResyncInProgress)[TRN(Status.DialPosNests,DialNearstStaPosHeads) ADD(DialNearstStaPosHeads,0.1,DialFwdRevHeadPos) GRT(Status.DialPosNests,DialFwdRevHeadPos) [ADD(DialNearstStaPosHeads,1,DialNearstStaPosHeads) ,OTL(DialMoveFwdToResync) ] ,GRT(DialNearstStaPosHeads,Setup_NestQty) MOV(1,DialNearstStaPosHeads) ,CPT(DialNearstStaPosDeg,(DialNearstStaPosHeads-1)*(360.0/Setup_NestQty)) ,MAM(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAM_DialNearstInst,RotaryShortest,DialNearstStaPosDeg,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) [XIC(MAM_DialNearstInst.PC) [XIO(DialMoveFwdToResync) MOV(12,StateReg) ,XIC(DialMoveFwdToResync) MOV(13,StateReg) ] ,OTU(DialMoveFwdToResync) ] ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 12
Cam Move Reverse To Dial Index Start Cam Position -1
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[12])OTL(Status.ResyncInProgress)[SUB(Setup_DialIndexStartCamPosDeg,1,DialStartIndexMinusOne) MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_CamRevToStartInst,RotaryNegative,DialStartIndexMinusOne,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) XIC(MAM_CamRevToStartInst.PC) MOV(15,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 13
Cam Move Forward To Dial Index End Cam Position +1
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[13])OTL(Status.ResyncInProgress)[ADD(Setup_DialIndexEndCamPosDeg,1,DialEndIndexPlusOne) MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_CamFwdToEndInst,RotaryPositive,DialEndIndexPlusOne,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) XIC(MAM_CamFwdToEndInst.PC) MOV(15,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 14
Cam Move To Start-Up Position
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[14])[MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_CamStartupInst,RotaryPositive,Setup_CamStartupPosDeg,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Vel,Units per sec,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Acc,Units per sec2,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,Setup_ResyncMoveParams.Jerk,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0,0,0) XIC(MAM_CamStartupInst.PC) MOV(15,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(50,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 15
Enable Cam/Dial Camming 
(MAM)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[15])NEQ(Setup_NestQty,0)DIV(360.0,Setup_NestQty,NestSpacing)[MOV(0,CamProfileArray[0].Master) ,MOV(0,CamProfileArray[0].Slave) ,MOV(0,CamProfileArray[0].SegmentType) ][MOV(Setup_DialIndexStartCamPosDeg,CamProfileArray[1].Master) ,MOV(0,CamProfileArray[1].Slave) ,MOV(1,CamProfileArray[1].SegmentType) ][MOV(Setup_DialIndexEndCamPosDeg,CamProfileArray[2].Master) ,MOV(NestSpacing,CamProfileArray[2].Slave) ,MOV(0,CamProfileArray[2].SegmentType) ][MOV(360.0,CamProfileArray[3].Master) ,MOV(NestSpacing,CamProfileArray[3].Slave) ,MOV(0,CamProfileArray[3].SegmentType) ]MCCP(MCCP_Inst,CamProfileArray,4,0,0,CamProfile)MAPC(Setup_DialAxisTag,Setup_CamAxisTag,MAPC_CamDialInst,0,CamProfile,1,1,Continuous,Immediate,0,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,New Cam,Actual,Bi-Directional)XIC(MAPC_CamDialInst.IP)XIC(Setup_DialAxisTag.PositionCamStatus)MOV(20,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 20
Camming Enabled, Chassis Ready For Cycle Start

Control.JogChassis is intended to be used by a HMI jog button. For this situation, The Chassis should jog without any stations functioning.
Control.AutoJogChassis needs to come from the Mode program logic. Mode logic contains proper starting and stopping conditions. During this condition, all stations function as during normal Auto Cycle Running.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[20])OTU(Status.ResyncInProgress)OTU(Status.Running)OTU(Status.Stopping)[XIO(Control.ImmedStop) [XIC(Setup_AutoMode) XIO(Control.AutoRunChassis) XIO(Control.ImmedPause) OTE(Status.ReadyCycleStart) ,XIC(Control.AutoRunChassis) XIC(Setup_AutoMode) XIO(Control.ImmedPause) MOV(21,StateReg) ,XIO(Control.AutoRunChassis) [XIO(Setup_AutoMode) XIC(Control.JogChassis) ,XIC(Setup_AutoMode) XIC(Control.AutoJogChassis) XIO(Control.ImmedPause) ] MOV(30,StateReg) ] ,XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(40,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 21
Chassis Jog - Used during auto running]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[21])XIC(Control.EnableChassisSlaveMode)ONS(OS_WriteLockPosition)MOV(Status.CamPosDeg,MasterLockPos);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[21])[XIO(Control.EnableChassisSlaveMode) MAJ(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAJ_CamInst,Forward,Control.Run.Vel,Units per sec,Control.Run.Acc,Units per sec2,Control.Run.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Control.Run.Jerk,Control.Run.Jerk,Units per sec3,Disabled,0,0,None) ,XIC(Control.EnableChassisSlaveMode) MAJ(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAJ_CamSlaveInst,Forward,Control.Run.Vel,Units per MasterUnit,0.01,Units per MasterUnit2,0.01,Units per MasterUnit2,Trapezoidal,1,1,Units per MasterUnit3,Disabled,1,MasterLockPos,Position Forward Only) ]MOV(22,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 22
Chassis Jogging
Chassis Running Signal
(Chassis Wait For Stop Position Signal When NOT Cycle Running)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[22])[OTL(Status.Running) ,XIO(Control.AutoRunChassis) SUB(Setup_CamStartupPosDeg,Setup_StartupStopChkSub,StartupPosLL) [GEQ(StartupPosLL,0) [GRT(Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,Setup_CamStartupPosDeg) ,LES(Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,StartupPosLL) ] ,LES(StartupPosLL,0) ADD(StartupPosLL,360,StartupPosLL) GRT(Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,Setup_CamStartupPosDeg) LES(Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,StartupPosLL) ] MOV(24,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedPause) XIO(Control.ImmedStop) XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(25,StateReg) ,[XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) ] MOV(23,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(State[22]) SUB(Setup_DialIndexStartCamPosDeg,5,DialPhaseOffsetCheckCamPosDeg) LES(DialPhaseOffsetCheckCamPosDeg,0) ADD(DialPhaseOffsetCheckCamPosDeg,360,DialPhaseOffsetCheckCamPosDeg) ,Chassis_CamPos_Check(CamPosChk1,DialPhaseOffsetCheckCamPosDeg,Setup_CamAxisTag.ActualPosition,0,Status.ActualVelocity) XIC(State[22]) [CPT(DialPhaseOffsetDeg,(Setup_DialAxisTag.ActualPosition MOD (360/Setup_NestQty))) ,GRT(DialPhaseOffsetDeg,2) CPT(DialPhaseOffsetDeg,DialPhaseOffsetDeg - (360/Setup_NestQty)) ,[DIV(Setup_OnStaTolDeg,2,OnStaTolHalfDeg) GRT(DialPhaseOffsetDeg,OnStaTolHalfDeg) ,SUB(0,OnStaTolHalfDeg,OnStaTolHalfDeg) LES(DialPhaseOffsetDeg,OnStaTolHalfDeg) ] SUB(0,DialPhaseOffsetDeg,DialPhaseOffsetDeg) MAM(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAM_DialPhaseCorrect,Incremental,DialPhaseOffsetDeg,1,Units per sec,1,Units per sec2,1,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,0,0,Units per sec3,Disabled,0,0,None,0,0) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 23
Chassis Immediate Fast Stop
(Camming Has Been Enabled)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[23])OTL(Status.Stopping)MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_CamInstImmed,All,Yes,Control.FastStopDec,Units per sec2,No,0,% of Maximum)XIC(MAS_CamInstImmed.DN)[XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(20,StateReg) ,XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(40,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 24
Chassis Controlled Cycle Stop
Chassis Stopping Signal]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[24])OTE(Status.MovingStartStopPos)OTL(Status.Stopping)[XIO(Control.ImmedStop) MAM(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAM_STOP_CamInst,RotaryPositive,Setup_CamStartupPosDeg,Control.Run.Vel,Units per sec,Control.Run.Acc,Units per sec2,Control.Run.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,Control.Run.Jerk,Control.Run.Jerk,Units per sec3,Enabled,0,0,None,0,0) XIC(MAM_STOP_CamInst.PC) MOV(20,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(23,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="25" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 25
Chassis Immediate Stop To Pause (Slower than regular Immediate Stop)
(Camming Has Been Enabled)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[25])OTL(Status.Stopping)MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_CamInstPause,All,Yes,Control.Run.Dec,Units per sec2,Yes,Control.Run.Jerk,Units per sec3)XIC(MAS_CamInstPause.DN)[XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank) XIO(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(20,StateReg) ,XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) MOV(40,StateReg) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) MOV(23,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="26" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 30
Chassis Slow Jog - Used With Jog Button
Chassis Jogging Signal]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[30])MAJ(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAJ_CamJogInst,Forward,Control.Jog.Vel,Units per sec,Control.Jog.Acc,Units per sec2,Control.Jog.Dec,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,0,0,% of Maximum,Disabled,0,0,0)MOV(31,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="27" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 31
Chassis Jogging
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[31])[OTE(Status.Jogging) ,[XIO(Control.JogChassis) XIO(Control.AutoJogChassis) ,XIC(Setup_IN_HandCrank) ,XIC(Control.ImmedStop) ] MOV(32,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="28" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 32
Chassis Stop Jogging
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[32])MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_CamJogInst,Jog,Yes,Control.Jog.Dec,Units per sec2,No,0,% of Maximum)XIC(MAS_CamJogInst.DN)MOV(20,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="29" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 40
Servo OFF CAM Servo Drive
(MSF)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[40])OTU(Status.ResyncInProgress)OTU(Status.Running)OTU(Status.Stopping)MSF(Setup_CamAxisTag,MSF_Cam_Inst)XIC(MSF_Cam_Inst.DN)XIO(Setup_CamAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus)MOV(41,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="30" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 41
Ready To Hand Crank Signal]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[41])OTE(Status.ReadyHandCrank)XIO(Setup_IN_HandCrank)MOV(42,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 42
Servo ON CAM Servo Drive
(MSO)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[42])MSO(Setup_CamAxisTag,CHAS_MSO_CamCrankInst)XIC(CHAS_MSO_CamCrankInst.DN)XIC(Setup_CamAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus)MOV(20,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="32" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 50
--Immediate Stop--
(Camming Has Not Been Enabled)
-Stop All Motion
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[50])OTL(Status.Stopping)OTU(Status.ResyncInProgress)[MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_ImmStpCamInst,All,Yes,Control.FastStopDec,Units per sec2,No,0,% of Maximum) ,MAS(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAS_ImmStpDialInst,All,Yes,10,% of Maximum,No,0,% of Maximum) ,XIC(MAS_FaultCamInst.PC) XIC(MAS_FaultDialInst.PC) OTU(Status.Running) MOV(8,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="33" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 60
--Faulted--
-Stop All Motion
-Set Chassis Faulted Status
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[60])OTL(Status.Stopping)OTU(Status.ResyncInProgress)[MAS(Setup_CamAxisTag,MAS_FaultCamInst,All,Yes,Control.FastStopDec,Units per sec2,No,0,% of Maximum) ,MAS(Setup_DialAxisTag,MAS_FaultDialInst,All,Yes,95,% of Maximum,No,0,% of Maximum) ,[XIC(MAS_FaultCamInst.ER) ,XIC(MAS_FaultCamInst.PC) ] [XIC(MAS_FaultDialInst.ER) ,XIC(MAS_FaultDialInst.PC) ] MOV(61,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="34" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 61
-Servo OFF Cam Servo Drive (MSF)
-Servo OFF Dial Servo Drive (MSF)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[61])OTU(Status.Stopping)OTU(Status.Running)[MSF(Setup_CamAxisTag,MSF_FaultCamInst) ,[XIC(MSF_FaultCamInst.DN) ,XIC(MSF_FaultCamInst.ER) ] XIO(Setup_CamAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus) MSF(Axis_Dial,MSF_FaultDialInst) [XIC(MSF_FaultDialInst.DN) ,XIC(MSF_FaultDialInst.ER) ] XIO(Setup_DialAxisTag.DriveEnableStatus) MOV(62,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="35" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STATE 62
Chassis Faulted]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(State[62])XIO(Status.Faulted)MOV(0,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="36" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[****IMMEDIATE TRANSITIONS****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="37" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(FaultActive) ,XIC(IndexPermFaultActive) ][OTE(Status.Faulted) ,XIO(State[60]) XIO(State[61]) XIO(State[62]) MOV(60,StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="38" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Setup_SafetyCircuitOK)MOV(0,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="39" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This Instruction Controls The State Logic Engine. ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[Chassis_State_Engine(AOI_ChassisStateEngine,State,StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="40" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[****RUNTIME HOURS****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="41" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.Running) ,XIC(Status.Jogging) ,XIC(Status.Stopping) ][MOV(3600000,Tmr_RuntimeHrs.PRE) RTO(Tmr_RuntimeHrs,?,?) ,XIC(Tmr_RuntimeHrs.DN) ONS(OneShot.31) ADD(Status.RuntimeHours,1,Status.RuntimeHours) RES(Tmr_RuntimeHrs) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="42" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(ManualControl,0)JSR(FaultsWarnings,0)JSR(OilPump,0)JSR(_Help_Info,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
